menu "espix tracing"

    config ESPIX_TRACE_CORE
        int "SystemView: CPU whose scheduling is traced (0 or 1)"
        depends on ESP_TRACE_LIB_EXTERNAL
        range 0 1
        default 0
        help
            The USB-Serial/JTAG transport carries one SystemView stream, so the
            encoder can represent the scheduling events of one CPU only; the
            other CPU's task and ISR state changes are dropped. espix pins
            espix:vnc to CPU1, so profiling the desktop/display path wants 1 and
            the network/ssh side wants 0. The JTAG transport is multi-core and
            ignores this, but S31 apptrace does not work in OpenOCD yet.
            See docs/PROFILING.md.

endmenu
